  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vyankatesh Ganesh Chidrawar vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 29 July, 2025 1324.25aba (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 916-2 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1324 Of 2025 Vyankatesh Ganesh Chidrawar Versus The State Of Maharashtra and Anr. ..... Mr S. J. Salunke, Advocate for Applicant.",
    "facts": "4. The Application is filed under Section 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023, as the Applicant apprehends arrest. The proceedings relate to Crime No.0420/2025. The FIR is dated 08 July 2025 at 21:42 hours registered by the Pathari Police Station, District Parbhani. The offences alleged are under 1324.25aba (2) Sections 59(i) 59(ii) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Vyankatesh Ganesh Chidrawar vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 29 July, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/137612383/ 1 under Sections 123, 223, 274, 275 and 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023. The occurrence of the alleged offence is shown on 08 July 2025. The informant is one Santosh Uttamrao Maral, aged 36 years who is P.S.I. of the Pathari Police Station. 5. The present Applicant is alleged to be recipient of the said scented gutkha. Learned Advocate for the Applicant Mr Salunke would submit that the name of this Applicant has been taken from the statement of the co-accused persons recorded during the investigation. 6. It appears that the FIR/Crime is the same as in Anticipatory Bail Application No.857/2025. The parties would not dispute that the issue involved in this Application is similar and is covered by the orders passed in Anticipatory Bail Application No.857/2025 and other companion Anticipatory Bail Applications.",
